[Briefing]
1=This is it Commander! Take out CABAL fast and hard: No mercy and no
2=surrender. Find a way to get inside his defenses and take out the core.
3=GDI forces are distracting CABAL and now is the perfect time to crush
4=CABAL once and for all.@ DATA LINK CLOSED.@@ First Objective: Build your
5=base and survive the initial onslaught from CABAL.@@ Second Objective:
6=Capture or destroy the 3 control stations to shut down the laser fences and
7=firestorm defense system protecting CABAL.@@ Third Objective: Destroy
8=CABAL core.

